## 💬 USAGE EXAMPLES

Example 1 — Machine status (API)

       User: What is the status of M-102?
       Agent: The status of M-102 is Maintenance. The current temperature is 42°C
              and its last maintenance was on August 15, 2026.

Example 2 — Document query (RAG)

       User: What does the manual say about risk assessment?
       Agent: According to manual.pdf (page 14), risk assessment is a fundamental aspect
              of safety work...

Example 3 — Multi-tool (RAG + API)

       User: According to the manual, what should I do if M-102 exceeds 40°C?
       Agent: According to the manual, if the temperature of M-102 exceeds 40°C,
              you should perform immediate maintenance.

Example 4 — Follow-up (Memory)

       User: What is the status of M-102?
       Agent: Maintenance, 42°C.
       User: And its temperature?
       Agent: The temperature of M-102 is 42°C.

Example 5 — No tool needed (NONE)

       User: What is 2+2?
       Agent: 2+2 = 4



## 🧪 RUNNING TESTS 

python -m pytest

Expected output:

text
tests/test_memory.py .......... [ 50%]
tests/test_router.py ......    [ 80%]
tests/test_tools.py .....      [100%]

========================= 18 passed in 26.00s =========================
Note: test_tools.py requires the FastAPI server to be running and the vector store to be built.



## ⚙️ CONFIGURATION

All parameters are centralized in src/config.py:

# --- LLM CONFIGURATION ---
LLM_MODEL = "llama3.2:3b"   
TEMPERATURE = 0
NUM_CTX = 4096
NUM_PREDICT = 300

# --- API CONFIGURATION (YOUR LOCAL SERVER!) ---
API_BASE_URL = "http://127.0.0.1:8000"

# --- SEMANTIC ROUTER CONFIGURATION ---
# Minimum similarity score to accept a label from the semantic router.
ROUTER_THRESHOLD = 0.45

# Minimum score for NONE (higher to avoid false positives).
ROUTER_NONE_THRESHOLD = 0.70

# --- MEMORY CONFIGURATION ---
# Maximum number of exchanges to keep in memory (sliding window).
MEMORY_MAX_HISTORY = 10


PARAMETER	       DESCRIPTION

LLM_MODEL	       Ollama model to use
TEMPERATURE	       LLM creativity (0 = deterministic)
NUM_CTX	       Maximum context tokens
NUM_PREDICT	       Maximum output tokens
API_BASE_URL	       Local API server URL
ROUTER_THRESHOLD	Minimum similarity for API/RAG
ROUTER_NONE_THRESHOLDMinimum similarity for NONE
MEMORY_MAX_HISTORY	Max conversation exchanges to remember



## ⚠️ LIMITATIONS

The API data is mocked (hardcoded in src/server/main.py). It is a proof of concept, not a real database.

The LLM (llama3.2:3b) is small — it works well for this use case but is not a general-purpose assistant.

No persistence — the vector store is rebuilt from PDFs, the memory is in-process only.

Router threshold tuning — may need adjustment depending on your documents and questions.



